1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:08,900
We need your okay by noon. The kitchen clip's the only part that feels personal.

2
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:13,460
Why is it on the investigation page?

3
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,180
It's below the response. Same page.

4
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:26,740
Then people won't know where one stops.

5
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,660
People need to remember him.

6
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:46,360
The company statement can stay. Take our video out. I'm not signing this.

7
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:58,800
Okay. We'll take it out. I'll send you a new version.

8
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:05,450
No footage of the children. And send it to my lawyer.

9
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:13,130
You called him polite.

10
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:18,210
When he ordered. That's what I was asked.

11
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:38,900
That clip's been on all week. Did anyone ask what Brian was like at home?

12
00:01:39,550 --> 00:01:45,550
I didn't know your husband. They asked me about that morning.

13
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:57,230
Can you say that again? Thursday at ten?

14
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:00,740
By the window. It's quieter.

15
00:02:01,390 --> 00:02:05,300
Thursday at ten. Bring the medication list.

16
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:12,480
I can't take calls at work. If it changes, leave a message.

17
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:24,330
School wants a photo for the memorial thing. Do I have to?

18
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:30,460
No. I'll answer. You don't have to send them anything.

19
00:02:31,110 --> 00:02:35,540
They said everyone else's parents already sent one.

20
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:43,800
I'll email them. You don't need to explain it at school.

21
00:02:44,450 --> 00:02:48,880
I found the plane. The wing's still off.

22
00:02:49,530 --> 00:02:52,390
He said Saturday, didn't he?

23
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:03,800
He kept saying Saturday. I thought he was putting me off.

24
00:03:04,450 --> 00:03:12,030
I know. You were waiting for him to fix it. I'd be mad too.

25
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:25,380
Leave it there. I'll be home before dinner. We can look at it together.
